OL,3,GNEWSARoundabout redesign roadworks set
OL,4,Ato start
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans to redesign a roundabout in
OL,7,FNottinghamshire to reduce congestion
OL,8,Fare due to start next week.
OL,10,FThe junction at Lowdham is one of five
OL,11,Fin the A614/A6097 major road network
OL,12,Fscheme, with work due to be carried out
OL,13,Fby Galliford Try on behalf of
OL,14,FNottinghamshire County Council and Via
OL,15,FEast Midlands.
OL,17,FPaths for pedestrians and cyclists will
OL,18,Fbe widened as part of the project, with
OL,19,Fnew pedestrian crossings added and the
OL,20,Fspeed limit reduced on all approaches
OL,21,Fto the new roundabout.
OL,23,APub: 19-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,370,360,200,160,0,100
