OL,3,GNEWSARoundabout redesign roadworks set
OL,4,Ato start
OL,5,
OL,6,FTemporary traffic signals and lane
OL,7,Freductions will be in place while work
OL,8,Fis carried out, with motorists using
OL,9,Fthe route advised to add extra time to
OL,10,Ftheir journeys from Sunday.
